# The network of "Write reach-matrix": the shop's apps network on its own,
# with the access proxy's machine and the three it stands in front of.
#
#   zt .2     wiki .10    payroll .11    db .12
#   ===+=========+===========+============+=== apps 10.20.0.0/24
#
# wiki drops what it doesn't accept, payroll refuses it, and db has no
# firewall at all: one of each, for trying the script out.
machine zt
machine wiki
machine payroll
machine db

lan apps zt:eth0=10.20.0.2/24 wiki:eth0=10.20.0.10/24 payroll:eth0=10.20.0.11/24 db:eth0=10.20.0.12/24

run wiki nginx nftables
run payroll nginx nftables
